commit e59ca7127e5c8d902bb3223897b84c20ef7fceb8

C03: wrong-actor veto moves to the payload defect that gates acceptance; scan-limit defect reverted (NETWORK1297)

llm: action_attributed_to_user is now returned by _payload_fact_defect (blocked → not publishable) instead of only labelling the audit; missing_scan_limit exhausted every wifi.status draft into no_response and is removed (documented condition).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>


